        "text": "The axis is saved as my_fog in your ComfyUI user/steer folder. Next time it also appears in the Dial menu under Custom.\nIts safe range is an ESTIMATE, not a measurement: the Essentials in the other templates were checked against a benchmark, yours was not. Trust the Before | After picture.\nIf nothing changes, make the two prompts differ more. If the picture falls apart, lower Amount.\nWorks with image models that take plain text prompts (Z-Image shown)."
      },
